         )
     })?;
 
+    // CodeBrix change: esbuild would have bundled the `snippets/` folder that wasm-bindgen
+    // writes beside the glue file into the glue file itself. Without esbuild the glue file is
+    // copied as it is and still imports `./snippets/...`, so the folder is copied beside the
